		{"text"},
		line=917,
	},
	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010050c"},
		line=917,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"After training, Akari and I rested until early afternoon, after which we begin helping out at the shop.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“What?! You seriously went training after all that?!”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Ahhh, you young'uns... I admire you, I really do.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"The manager is sprawled out on the floor in the back of the shop.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll take care of everything, so you can just keep resting.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“You're a lifesaver.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Can I ask you to decorate the store in that case? Our Persica Blossom Festival decorations just came in.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I leave the rest... to you... Soujin-kun...”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Manager?!”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"The manager says his last before his consciousness expires.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"I get scared for a second and stupidly check his pulse, but\nhe's very much alive and well, just sleeping.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I got worked up for nothing...",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Alright, let's get to it.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, let's get it done.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Akari gives me her usual smile, but there's an unmistakable shadow of disquiet deep within her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"This doesn't seem like the sort of thing that will go away after a long night's sleep, either.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I'll have to keep an eye on her while we work.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Looks like the peach blossoms came in awfully late this year.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. They've only barely started.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“On top of that, apparently we're getting some snow this Sunday.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Snow, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Akari sighs as she puts up posters and artificial flowers.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"The Persica Blossom Festival takes place tomorrow and the day after.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Typically, the Persica would be in full bloom by now, but\nthey're late this year.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not that I'm happy about it, but we do get real busy during years when they're late to bloom.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'Cause more people come to buy peach flowers, right?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Exactly.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll have to start wrapping the bouquets this afternoon to get them ready in time.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"I'm busy gluing colorful papercraft flowers to the shop's windows at the moment.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Out of the corner of my eye, I see Empress Hisui displayed on the shop's television through the window.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"The media is all abuzz with talk of Empress Hisui's engagement.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Akari's hands stop moving.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"She stares at the screen with a slightly forlorn expression on her face.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What will become of the Empire now?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"She absently asks with a sigh to herself.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If the marriage goes through, a Republican will be part of the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Everything the Republic doesn't like is going to start disappearing.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And in the future, once Empress Hisui's heir takes the throne, we'll never be able to rise up against the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We'll be the Republic's vassal state in name and fact, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What're the Sworn Blades planning to do? Just twiddle your thumbs and watch?”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'd love nothing more than to put a stop to the whole thing, but we can't afford to make our move yet.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But if you don't, who will?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"On the television screen, reporters are swarming around Okonogi, trying to confirm the veracity of the rumors.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Okonogi neither confirms nor denies anything, dodging their questions with a pompous sneer.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"A hue of grim resolve spreads across Akari's countenance as she stares at the proceedings.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You wouldn't be thinking of doing anything hasty, would you?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course not... I would never...”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You think I'm gonna believe you when you're looking like that?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Akari takes a look at her own reflection in the window.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hehee, I sure look terrible.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The festival's right around the corner. I should try and cheer up.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You should call it a day and get some rest.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's fine. I want to work.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hey, Akari... What really happened last night?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You haven't acted like yourself all day.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I already told you everything. That's all.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm just fine. Don't worry about me.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Be honest with...”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Right when I try to follow up, my cell phone rings.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Hotori's calling me.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin? We've got a problem.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"I can tell from her voice that the situation is pretty urgent.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Five warriors from Maki's faction just turned in their resignations.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“They're the ones from yesterday who wanted to stage an uprising.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If they're breaking off now of all times, they must be aiming for the Armistice Day ceremony.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I thought so too.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We need to put a stop to them before it's too late.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What about Maki himself?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“He wasn't one of them, but I can't get a hold of him either.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“He definitely knows what's going on.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sorry, but can you help us look for Maki? We need all the help we can get.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right. Send me the names and pictures of the guys that quit.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“At this rate, we'll have to cancel our retrieval operation on Armistice Day.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's unavoidable.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Anyways, talk to you later.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We've got trouble at the Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"I explain the general gist of the situation.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I suppose the warriors who resigned couldn't stand not doing anything.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I totally get how they feel...”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're just taking the easy way out. They aren't thinking about the consequences or how they'll affect those around them.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And that upsets you?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"It goes without saying, and my expression tells her everything she needs to know.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Akari casts her gaze downward with a forlorn look on her face.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mhm. You're totally in the right, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm going to go look for Maki.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, would you take me with you?”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I think it's safer if we stick together.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"There's no guarantee Akari won't get attacked again.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"She'd be safer coming with me than staying home all alone.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Only if you follow my instructions. Can you promise me that?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I promise.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"We explain the situation to the manager, and Akari and I take to the streets.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"We go around to the places Maki is likely to visit and ask after him.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Eventually, a new day rolls over.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"We still haven't heard anything about any of the resignees, but we did run into an eyewitness account of Maki.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Supposedly, he was drifting around the downtown area next to the Republican occupation zone.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"We prowl the nearby streets in search of more reliable information.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"─Hmm?",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"I hear a muffled scream coming from somewhere.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"It's nearby.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Keeping my guard up, I move towards where the voice came from.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"A solitary man slowly comes into view out of the pitch-black alleyway between two tall high-rises.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"It's as though he's being spit out from the darkness.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Tokita, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of all the places to find you...”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Maki yanks a handkerchief from his pocket and begins wiping his knuckles clean.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Behind him, two Republican soldiers are laying collapsed in the alley.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did you kill them?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Like hell. They ain't dead.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“They were followin' me around, so I had to shut 'em up before they saw my face.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Maki casually tosses aside the bloodstained handkerchief and begins sauntering away.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are you gonna do about them?”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Leave 'em to rot.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Gonna be a good boy and call in the Army to come an' kill you?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Maki doesn't stop walking.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Keeping my distance, I throw my voice at his receding back.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sure you're aware that several members have resigned.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Isn't it awfully irresponsible for the vice chairman to cut off contact at a time like this?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Spare me the damn lecture. Get to the point.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tell me where they're hiding.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“And what if I do?”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Judging by the way he spoke, Maki knows where they are.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"It wouldn't even be strange if he just finished meeting up with them.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll stop them from going rogue.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“If they up and quit, they can do whatever they damn please.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So you'd leave them to their own devices, even if they went after Okonogi or Warren?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Damn straight.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Assassinating them won't change a thing. It'll only strengthen their security and put us at even more...”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I don't give a rat's ass about any of that.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Maki stops walking and turns to face me.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“People are only as sharp as their ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"spirit.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Fortune only favors those with fullness of spirit. Strike then, and let the results fall where they may.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Even should the fates betray you, there could be no greater end than fightin' and dyin' with purpose.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"The Koubukan emphasizes “fighting spirit.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Referring to morale and the will to fight, they believe that superiority of “fighting spirit” is capable of making a decisive difference even against overwhelming odds.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"It's an ethos wholly incompatible with the Myougikan's precept of “heart and blade in concord,” which calls for the expurgation of one's volition from their bladesmanship.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"If the Myougikan's teachings were a pristine and taintless blade of cold steel, the Koubukan's would be a flame-wreathed blade of scorching iron.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We all swore the same oath to restore the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If they can't possibly hope to succeed, they'll just be dying in vain!”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Dyin' in vain, eh?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Maki shoves his hands into his pockets.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“They say they wanna go for it. I say we let 'em.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Ain't it more in vain to die fightin' for a cause you don't believe in?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The people will not rally behind a fight without justice on its side.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Who gives a damn about what the people think?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“They've gone as far as to resign. Their minds're already made up.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Maki seems intent to let the resignees do as they please.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Even though he knows full well that it'll bring ruin to the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Or perhaps...",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"It could just be that he's planning to deal with the resignees himself?",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"You can never tell what this man is really thinking, after all.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Can't you at least let me try to talk some sense into them?”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hmm... And what'll you do if you can't talk 'em down?”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"I'll have to stop them by force.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"We absolutely cannot afford to let them carry out their plans.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Gonna kill anyone who doesn't fall in line, eh?”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Ain't that just tyranny of the majority? That's real hypocritical of you.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Kazuma smiles out of the corner of his mouth.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Having reached the limit of her patience, Akari finally speaks up.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aren't you supposed to be the vice chairman? How can you just sit idly by and watch the Blades fall into chaos?!”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I ain't living my life for the sake of the Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Maki brushes Akari off.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"If we back down now, it's all over.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"We have to find out where they're hiding no matter what.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"My cell phone suddenly rings out.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"It's from Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"I have a bad feeling about this, but I answer the phone anyway.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"I lower the phone from my ear and heave a heavy sigh.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"My hunch was spot-on.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We were too late.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa got to them in an abandoned house on the edge of town.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“They're all goners, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, no survivors.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"I meet Maki's gaze.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"For just a moment, I spot a burning rage flash in the back of his eyes.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Heh... Hahaha...”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Lucky you. She spared you the trouble of takin' care of\n'em yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"With that, Maki turns his back on me again.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Where do you think you're going?”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Gonna pour one out for 'em.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"Practically spitting those last few words out, Kazuma leaps into the darkness.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"His poorly concealed sentiments leave a glistening trail in the night sky.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Akari and I are left all alone on the street below.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"The bitter taste left in my mouth by this whole incident somehow amplifies the biting chill of the wind.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Are you satisfied?”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course not... I wanted them to be able to rejoin us.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But you were intending to kill them if you couldn't talk them down, weren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Maybe.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And because of that, even though things turned out this way, my hands are just as stained.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They were my comrades! Just yesterday, we were all fighting for the same cause...”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"I might have been forced to strike them down for the sake of the Blades.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"But that's the last thing I'd ever want to have to do.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So you were gonna kill them!”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Those guys weren't able to stand just doing nothing. Isn't that what fealty is all about?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Akari lashes out at me.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They placed their personal desires over fulfilling their sworn duties.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Someone still has to step up and stop Empress Hisui's marriage, don't they?”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That doesn't mean there aren't right and wrong ways to go about it.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't lose sight of the bigger picture. Our objective is the restoration of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Shouldn't you of all people be the first to denounce\nMaki's actions?”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Akari pierces me with a sharp glare.",
			},
